From: Xiao Xiang <baron@macos.shared>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:34:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Add a native macOS Server app and package lifecycle

Install RStudioServer.app separately from Electron Desktop, manage its LaunchDaemon with ServiceManagement, and add persistent network controls plus account-management help. Package system preparation and an explicit uninstaller that preserve user data and pre-existing configuration. Include dependency-light administration and installation checks.
